# Build artifacts assembled by scripts/build-public-site.mjs and uploaded by
# Wrangler from the working directory — git never needs them. The composites are
# ~12.6MB and the card index 1.7MB PER REBUILD, and git keeps every version
# forever; tracking them would add several GB a year to a 30MB repo.
